@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Upload an image -> Cloudinary -> URL saved in TBAssets
# Replace the file path with a real image on your machine
POST http://localhost:3001/api/assets/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test.png
------Boundary--

### My uploaded assets
GET http://localhost:3001/api/assets/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete an asset (removes it from Cloudinary too)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/assets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
